    Lab 1 — Kinematics
    Fully open environment. No walls, no obstacles, no landmarks — the robot
    drives on unbounded floor, so odometry can be exercised without any
    collision to interrupt it.
    Robot starts at the origin facing North.

    Note: with no boundary walls this environment cannot be used with
    start_position_generator.py, which requires a closed boundary polygon.
-->

